{
  "info": {
    "name": "SmartStay",
    "description": "All requests go through the API Gateway on port 5000, except the registry folder. Run folders 1 to 7 in order with all services up and a freshly seeded hotel database. Folders 8 and 9 contain manual failure demos.",
